From c628be50685cb0aeeabcf9866a4d51e1c944d761 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ElfHosted <hello@elfhosted.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 12:51:10 +1300
Subject: [PATCH] Optionally restrict signed-out visitors to an allowlist of
 views

ANONYMOUS_VIEW_ALLOWLIST (default off, upstream behaviour). When on, a
signed-out request reaches a login_not_required view only if it is on
an explicit allowlist: sign-in, token-authenticated machine endpoints and
API, OAuth device login, light probes. Detail pages, public profiles and
lists, full health and the rest then need a login.
---
